WEBVTT

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:02.940
Are you ready to count down?

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.860
There is no way out to run!

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:05.400
Hey!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:19.000
You shouldn't get into the decrepit firing range.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.170
The demilitarized zone is a boring place.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:28.720
So that makes us prodigies.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.760
There's way too much

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.470
self-derision; it doesn't end.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.430
I can't really show you

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:38.100
amusing follies.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.520
I'd just be getting you excited

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:42.780
for no reason.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.110
Are acceptance and rebellion the only two choices?

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:47.610
It's my aesthetics that say,

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.990
"I won't let anyone touch her."
dare ni mo sawarasenai

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:49.740
Hey!

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.780
My damaged innocence...

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.450
I'm the same person no matter what anyone says.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.500
I am being reaped.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.790
Nevertheless, I move forward without fail.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:03.000
It's fine if you believe in your

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.340
skirt's hem like a fool.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:12.430
It's okay for you to whisper

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:17.520
that you've been moved too far.
tanjun ni tsubuyakeba ii jan

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:33.570
"Who is the Winner? (Pop Quiz)"
Riddle 13

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.650
Everyone in Class Black, we have clear skies today!

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:39.320
The perfect day for our seaside summer camp!

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:43.700
All the little details you need to know about are in the Class Black Newsletter that I handed out today,

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:44.870
so be sure to read it carefully!

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:49.990
Oh, bananas won't count as a snack, so don't worry.

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:56.530
Uh, I brought lots of bananas, so let me know later if anyone wants one.

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:59.100
Now, listen, once we get to the island,

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:02.970
we'll first start by observing the plants that live there.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.870
So make sure you're ready for that.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:07.770
In particular, try to stay covered up as much as possible.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.970
Some of you are already in swimsuits,

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:12.710
but have you taken the proper steps to block those UV rays?

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:16.550
Blue skies! White clouds! That balmy breeze!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:19.150
I completely sympathize with how it makes you feel free and relaxed.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:21.480
But one careless moment can lead to a lifetime of regret.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:22.850
Carelessness is your greatest enemy.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.950
Make sure you take those precautions.

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:29.560
Oh, also, don't forget insect repellent before you disembark.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:33.200
Be careful not to get bitten by bugs as you observe those plants.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.920
Guess it's about time.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:32.230
You okay?

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.270
Where are we?

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.730
It's quiet.

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:42.070
Where's everyone else?

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:50.870
They should be fine.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.880
They're not the sort to die so easily.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.480
Ah! Ah!

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.550
Ah-ah-ah! Mic test in progress!

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:58.340
Test! test!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:03:58.380
Nio?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.130
Ah-ah!
Nio?

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:02.220
Everyone in Class Black, can you hear me?

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.820
It's orientation time!

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:07.160
Starting now, you all
will be killing each other...

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:08.720
Oh, no! I mean...

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:11.060
You all will be asked to swipe from one another!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.430
S-Swipe from one another?

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:14.660
That's right! Swipe from one another!

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.170
She can hear us?

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:17.630
I call it...

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:21.900
"Target Haru-chan! Seaside Summer Camp Edition!"

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:24.770
And now, I'll explain the rules.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:28.830
All of you are wearing
matching charms on your swimsuits.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:32.450
However, Haru-chan alone has a different-colored one.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:32.460
You guessed it!
However, Haru-chan alone has a different-colored one.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.850
You guessed it!

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.620
Whoever swipes Haru-chan's  charm

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:38.950
will be rewarded with...
Would you believe it? Whatever they desire!

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.090
So that's the deal.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:43.990
Then, all I have to do is give this to you, right?

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.660
Ah-ah, you can't do that!

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.500
What?

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:50.270
Haru-chan taking it off herself and giving it to someone is no good!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:55.170
There are treasure boxes all over this island containing weapons.

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:58.310
No weapons are allowed except for the ones you get from those boxes!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:02.680
However, you can use weapons that you swipe from other people.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:06.950
If you lose your charm or it breaks, that's instant disqualification!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.690
You can't let it come off your swimsuit, either.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:13.690
You have until sunset. Once the sun goes down, it's over!

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:16.790
Okay, then everyone, good luck to you!

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.230
Haru-chan, if by any chance you suffer a wardrobe malfunction,

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:21.630
you might ruin your prospects for marriage!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.800
Will Tokaku-san be able to guard Haru-chan's chastity?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.340
That'll be something to see!

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.340
Later!

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:31.810
I swear, this has turned into one hell of a seaside summer camp.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.410
Tokaku-san...

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:35.220
Let's start by securing our safety.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.660
I heard the rules.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:46.860
Your luck ran out when you ended up near me.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:50.430
I will waste no time in obtaining Ichinose-san's charm.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:03.720
O-Oh, dear, this is terrible. The sand...

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:09.920
You lose.

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:13.620
Hanabusa-san is disqualified!

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:16.020
You will be shown to the losers' area!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.590
Did you call me a loser?!

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:18.390
Yes!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:22.590
Disqualified people will be forcibly detained in the losers' area.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:24.430
Well, fine then.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:28.860
I was never all that keen on such a small-scale competition to begin with.

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:31.140
Well, then, a good day to you!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.870
I'll give you mine.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:41.220
Because I don't need anything else as long as I have you, Chitaru-san.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:47.390
Me, too. All I want is you by my side, Kirigaya.

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.800
Chitaru-san.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.130
Okay, escorting you two there as well.

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:03.170
Three down, huh? That was fast.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:13.250
Yes! Got a big one!

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:19.650
I'm going to be the winner of Class Black for sure this time.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.660
Who's there?

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:28.090
Uh, um...

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.530
Oh, it's you, Banba.

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:31.800
Um...

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:35.300
You can come with if you want.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.710
O-Okay.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:47.180
Oh-ho! A hot spring in a place like this.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:51.380
The water is just the right temperature.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:53.650
I think I may just hop right in.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:56.060
I'm going to go in search of weapons.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.220
All right. You be careful now.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:02.700
Kouko-chan is so serious.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:14.500
Oh? Isuke found something nice.

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:25.710
It's dark.

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:27.400
It's pitch black.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.180
If I were Azuma,

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:33.490
I think I'd start by moving Ichinose somewhere safe.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.920
That makes sense.

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:35.870
It does, right?

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:38.740
This place would be perfect for that purpose, but...

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:46.910
Banba?

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:51.750
I'll start with you first!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.850
M-My glasses!

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:01.720
My glasses... My glasses...

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.100
My glasses!

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:08.130
My bad. I stepped on them.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:26.310
I-It's so bright...

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.380
Time to check how sharp these are!

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:39.490
Fabulous, if I do say so myself!

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:41.390
Okay, I'm taking this.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:44.930
All right! Banba Mahiru-san, you're disqualified!

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:50.070
Now, how about we take this moment to check out the losers' area?

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:55.300
Young Mistress, the lobster and abalone are ready.

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:56.910
Thank you.

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:58.810
Some more meat as well, please.

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:00.250
Yes, right away.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:04.080
Please help yourself to as much as you like.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.350
Okay. We appreciate it, Hanabusa.

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.280
Oh, Kirigaya, the meat over here is cooked.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:12.920
Wow, thank you very much, Chitaru-san.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:15.020
The crab looks about ready, too.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.120
Here, this looks good, too.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:20.030
Man! Nothing but luxurious ingredients! Looks yummy!

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:25.030
This was Nio Hashiri, reporting to you live from the losers' area!

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.200
How is that for losers?

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:30.780
Lucky them. Haru wants to eat meat, too.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.980
Defeat is absolutely unacceptable.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.380
Uh...

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.350
Don't "uh" me.

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:42.350
B-But this time, it's not like Haru's life is in danger, so...

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.120
Harucchi, I've been looking for you!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.660
T-Takechi-san.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.200
I'll be all nice and cut you to pieces.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.360
That's one puny weapon.

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:56.370
Yours is, too!

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:58.000
Why you!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.720
That was a success.

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:12.990
And now you'll be disqualified.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.050
Just you remember this!

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:22.690
Takechi-san, you'll be taken to the losers' area!

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:24.830
So, Takechi failed, too.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.670
Azuma is formidable, as expected.

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:32.530
Inukai.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:36.750
Oh, Kaminaga-san, that's an awfully menacing thing you've got there.

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:41.210
Ta-da! And now, we're even.

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:45.280
Well, not like I'd ever lose to you, though.

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.620
Don't underestimate me!

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:57.760
That's a win for Isuke.

00:11:57.760 --> 00:11:59.740
Defeat isn't an option for me!

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.640
Down you go!

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.770
You can't run from Isuke.

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:07.480
L-Let me go, you...

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.550
I will, once I take this.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:15.710
Oh?

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:19.160
This kind of thing makes me want to peel it right off!

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:24.060
There! There! There!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:27.770
Okay, then. I'll work extra hard to make up for your absence.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:34.240
Kaminaga-san, disqualified!

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:43.410
I'm gonna report on where we're at with things right now!

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.740
Currently, six have been disqualified!

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:49.160
Good luck to you on the second half of the game!

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.820
I have never suffered such humiliation!

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:02.590
That felt good!

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.190
Go on, Banba-san. You needn't be shy, either.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.860
I will eat lots!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.630
Kirigaya, is it good?

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:11.510
Yes, Chitaru-san.

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:17.340
Okay, then! Good luck to those of you remaining out there!

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:20.380
Oh, this lobster is the best!

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:23.850
So, if we account for ourselves, that means there are four left.

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:26.290
Do you suppose there's still any meat left?

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:28.180
Sorry.

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:31.020
This isn't the time to be saying things like that, is it?

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:33.360
Bear with it until sunset.

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:35.060
R-Right.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:36.660
Haru will hang in there until then.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.840
You're hopeless.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.140
Make sure you catch it!

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:48.050
Okay!

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:49.680
Got it.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.550
My! That looks delicious.

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:54.740
Isuke-san!

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:58.850
If you're hungry,I'll send you to the losers' area.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:02.980
What can you do with that thing?

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:05.690
You're as silly as ever.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.370
It's mine!

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:15.600
Isuke-san?

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:16.770
Don't let your guard down.

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:20.580
Yup. Letting your guard down is a no-no.

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.880
Turned the tables on you!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.950
It's over now, Azuma-san.

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:33.360
You just go enjoy that barbecue.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:40.790
I'm the one who's going to win!

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:43.090
Hey! What do you think you're...

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:44.870
What is this stuff? It won't come off!

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:48.560
Let's go!

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:49.940
R-Right.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:57.620
Inukai Eisuke-san, come on right over to the losers' area!

00:14:58.640 --> 00:14:59.920
Honestly!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:09.820
Banba-san, how do you like the Hanabusa blend?

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.250
I-It's delicious.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:14.570
Now that I'm here, I'm drowning my sorrows with food!

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:20.300
Hey! Isuke was watching that piece of meat!

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:22.230
Your name was not on it.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.300
Let's not sweat the small stuff.

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:26.940
I'll kill you.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.190
Just what I wanted to hear!

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:31.320
Did your parents even bring you up right?!

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.410
The beef is good, but the pork is good, too.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:37.320
Oh, Chitaru-san, hold still.

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:43.190
It's delicious.

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:47.860
Okay, thanks for that eyeful!

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:49.690
Only a little longer until sunset.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:52.540
Who, oh who, will be the winner?

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:57.330
Dessert is served.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:59.340
Ooh!

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:07.540
Tokaku-san, maybe it's okay already...

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.680
...for us to become losers.

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.480
That's unacceptable.

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:14.180
I'm protecting you to the very end.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:15.450
My mind's made up.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.690
Tokaku-san...

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.390
Right! Haru will work hard, too!

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:24.460
Ah! Heavenly! Just heavenly!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:30.370
Oh, Shuto-san.

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:33.740
Ah, Haru-chan and Azuma-san.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:36.240
I see that you are hanging in there.

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:37.870
Have you been here the whole time?

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:40.740
Yes. I had grown tired from walking,

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:43.210
when I just happened to find this hot spring.

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:45.750
How about it? Care to join me?

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:48.150
Let's go.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:52.590
Ichinose!

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:54.390
You should come, too, Tokaku-san.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:56.260
The water's nice!

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:59.870
You idiot! Don't let your guard down! She's not a loser yet!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.170
It seems I win!

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:13.610
Tropical islands are the best!

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:15.840
The game isn't over yet.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:18.250
There's still time until sunset.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:20.120
Hand that over.

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:21.920
How menacing.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:23.550
Quick!

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:24.690
Give it back!

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:40.610
Yes! I win!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.100
S-Stop...

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:06.930
I'm going to be the Class Black winner!

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:17.310
On tropical islands, there's a red fruit called the betel nut.

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:21.340
Locals consider it a recreational treat and chew it like gum.

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:24.810
And it turns the inside of your mouth all red.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.590
What do you think? Fascinating, right?

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:33.770
I wonder if everyone in Class Black is all right...

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:41.330
What'll I do if I'm the only one on this island?

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:43.470
If that's true, let's be friends, huh?

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:46.610
That hurt!

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:50.640
Ow!

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:52.620
What the heck? That came out of nowhere.

00:18:58.550 --> 00:18:59.890
What's this?

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:07.360
All right! We have a winner!

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:12.400
The winner is our Class Black homeroom teacher, Mizorogi-sensei!

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:22.310
Haru wanted meat, too.

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:26.980
Yeah, right?

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:29.980
If I was going to lose anyway, I would've liked to stuff myself.

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:33.850
That looks nice.

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:36.480
Ichinose, don't be so unreasonable.

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:40.160
We should count our lucky stars just to have survived that shipwreck.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:43.220
That's our Sensei for you! Such inspiring words!

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:46.760
Really makes you seriously appreciate the value of life.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:48.100
Never mind that.

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:51.230
I'm not satisfied with our Sensei being the winner.

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:55.010
That's right. He wasn't a participant to begin with, right?

00:19:56.210 --> 00:20:00.780
Oh, no, he's definitely got what it takes to be a qualified participant.

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:01.780
See?

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.080
Oh-ho, so that was where it was.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.120
Then, we cannot complain.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.760
Maybe I should cut it off.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:13.090
You can't do that.

00:20:13.090 --> 00:20:14.720
That would be against the rules.

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.690
And the sun has long since set.

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:17.690
Yes.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:23.100
So, Sensei, what's your wish?

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.070
Huh? Uh, what's that about, Banba?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.570
It's a pain to explain, so we'll skip it.

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:30.310
So, what's your wish, Sensei?

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:32.370
Wish? Me?

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:35.380
Yes! Whatever you want'll be granted!

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:36.950
Let me think...

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:45.450
My wish is to safely see everyone in Class Black to graduation.

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:46.460
I guess?

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:51.090
Sensei is so unselfish.

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:53.290
Too unselfish, I'd say.

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:55.140
This is no fun.

00:20:57.470 --> 00:21:01.840
Sensei, Haru is truly glad to have landed in your class!

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:06.840
R-Really? I'm happy to have you for a student, too, Ichinose!

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:10.780
Everyone, additional ingredients have arrived!

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:13.150
Please help yourselves!

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:16.180
All right! I'm gorging myself!

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:19.490
Then, perhaps I shall partake of the meal as well.

00:21:19.490 --> 00:21:20.990
Yes.

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:23.100
Let me join in, too!

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:32.200
This turned into a fun seaside summer camp, didn't it?

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:33.700
How do you figure that?

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:36.170
Do you suppose next time will be our school field trip?

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:39.350
Wouldn't it be nice if we can all go together again then?

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:08.260
This world is always about whether to live or die

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:12.510
While everyone's hiding their scars

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:17.640
Even if they're cornered, they desperately try and run away

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:22.020
Even if they have a holy cross to bear

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:25.740
Fighting for

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:27.940
And wishing for

00:22:27.940 --> 00:22:31.190
The meaning of life

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:42.110
A motivation that never lets your courage falter

00:22:42.110 --> 00:22:46.500
Your tears and pain will eventually turn to soil

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:50.740
It doesn't look like there's time to find the reasons

00:22:50.740 --> 00:22:55.520
At any rate, if everything's allowed in this party,

00:22:55.920 --> 00:23:00.140
I don't want to stand in anyone's way

00:23:00.140 --> 00:23:03.920
It's impossible for everything to be perfect

00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:10.040
But if you're worn-out, you can't accomplish anything

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.580
Party

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:23.460
This is the real party
